IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nra-offences-powers`

-- National Registration Act 1965, ss 16 to 32 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or the National Registration Regulations (not retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_nra.py). Expected results were written
-- by hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`handing the card to a condo guard for no stated legal reason` MEANS Handover WITH
